                          <android.widget.TextView index="1" package="com.cyberlink.powerdirector.DRA140225_01" class="android.widget.TextView" text="【Wrong Hands】&#10;Claire wakes up in a messy bedroom, shocked to discover she is looking at her own reflection as Leo.&#10;&#10;【The Hallway Encounter】&#10;Stumbling into the school hallway, Claire in Leo's body runs into a classmate who treats her with unfamiliar, casual hostility.&#10;&#10;【Face to Face】&#10;Claire enters her own classroom and freezes upon seeing her adult body standing authoritatively at the chalkboard.&#10;&#10;【The Silent Interrogation】&#10;Leo corners Claire at the back desk during homeroom, demanding to know what kind of curse she placed on him.&#10;&#10;【A Forced Truce】&#10;Claire whispers instructions on how Leo must act as a teacher while Leo warns her about the impending principal inspection.&#10;&#10;【The Pop Quiz】&#10;Leo steps behind the teacher's podium and announces a surprise test designed to fail Claire in his body before she can intervene.&#10;&#10;Possible Characters:&#10;• Claire — Female lead, high school literature teacher trapped in Leo's body&#10;• Leo — Male lead, rebellious student piloting Claire's adult body&#10;• Marcus — Supporting character, aggressive high school classmate" resource-id="com.cyberlink.powerdirector.DRA140225_01:id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_body" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" scrollable="false" selected="false" bounds="[90,88][990,280]" displayed="true" a11y-important="true" screen-reader-focusable="false" drawing-order="2" showing-hint="false" text-entry-key="false" dismissable="false" a11y-focused="false" heading="false" live-region="0" context-clickable="false" content-invalid="false" window-id="381" />
